### Create Order
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "DiscountRate": 10,
  "Address": {
    "Line": "123 Main St",
    "Province": "Ontario",
